  },
  "behind": [
    {
      "dialogue": "After Scarlett changed into her tactical outfit, she swiftly cornered the rioters in the mall warehouse, her imposing presence leaving them no room to resist.",
      "characterName": "special:narration",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "Selling fake goods and hitting people! I'm calling the cops, I'm reporting this!",
      "characterName": "Sam",
      "characterImg": "character_01.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_02.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "I've already called the cops. You started the whole mess and trashed the mall. They'll arrest you for violent crimes.",
      "characterName": "Tiana",
      "characterImg": "result:q4t9b2m7",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_02.webp",
      "characterPos": 0
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "...I confess! Sam said he was sent by your mother, just to teach you how to run the mall.",
      "characterName": "Thug A",
      "characterImg": "character_03.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_02.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "Shut up!",
      "characterName": "Sam",
      "characterImg": "character_01.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_02.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "Sure enough, my stepmother is looking for trouble with me again.I'll hand Sam over to the police. The rest of you can leave.",
      "characterName": "Scarlett",
      "characterImg": "result:v2c7n5x4",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_02.webp",
      "characterPos": 0
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "After handling the Sam situation, Scarlett renovated the mall and organized themed events",
      "characterName": "special:narration",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "A week later",
      "characterName": "special:narration",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "Scarlett, it’s been a few days since you took over the mall. How’s it going?",
      "characterName": "Mr. Harrington",
      "characterImg": "character_02.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_03.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "Father, I—",
      "characterName": "Scarlett",
      "characterImg": "result:v2c7n5x4",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_03.webp",
      "characterPos": 0
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "Darling, as soon as she took over, she fired the old manager and brought in a bunch of fake goods.",
      "characterName": "Vivian",
      "characterImg": "character_04.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_03.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "She’s ruined the whole mall. We should strip her of her position immediately.",
      "characterName": "Vivian",
      "characterImg": "character_04.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_03.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "You still want to go up against me? Scarlett, you’re done for.",
      "characterName": "Vivian",
      "characterImg": "character_04.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_03.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
